  Slug: school-of-mentalism
  DisplayName: School of Mentalism
  IconPath: icons/sundries/books/book-purple-glyph.webp
  Description: "As a scholar, you know all too well the importance of a sound mind.
    Thus, you attended a school\u2014like the Farseer Tower or the Stone of the Seers\u2014that
    taught the arts of befuddling lesser minds with figments and illusions or implanted
    sensations and memories. Curriculum cantrips: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Daze],
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Figment] 1st: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dizzying
    Colors], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Sleep], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Sure
    Strike] 2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Illusory Creature], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Stupefy]
    3rd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dream Message], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mind
    Reading] 4th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Nightmare], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Vision
    of Death] 5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Hallucination], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Illusory
    Scene] 6th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Never Mind], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Phantasmal
    Calamity] 7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Project Image], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Warp
    Mind] 8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Disappearance], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Uncontrollable
    Dance] 9th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Phantasmagoria] School Spells
    initial: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Charming Push]; advanced: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Invisibility
    Cloak]"
